<p>		     1.8583/93  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0933/38  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5205/15  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.35/36   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.2700/20  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1824.7/5.2 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     118.30/40  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0213/63  Swedish Crowns</p>
